  Title: Getting Started
  Try: "Press Space to jump. The cube stretches on the jump and squashes on the landing
    \u2014 the harder the landing, the bigger. Then open 'Getting Started (Empty)'
    and build the same in five steps."
  See: '''Jump'' is a Feedback Player with one item (Transform/Scale/Punch). ''Land''
    links the package''s Land preset and plays with the fall speed as its intensity.
    The Rigidbody is on ''Hero''; the feedback shakes the child ''Body''.'
  Controls: "Space \xB7 Left click \xB7 Gamepad South \u2014 jump"
